flowchart TD
  EV["Evidence from the analysis"] --> CAND["Candidate rebuilds<br/>one function per file"]
  CAND --> L1["Leg 1 · Execute and compare<br/>original vs rebuild on an input grid"]
  CAND --> L2["Leg 2 · Recompile and compare<br/>the bytes"]
  L1 --> D{{"Both legs agree?"}}
  L2 --> D
  D -->|"yes"| OK["Proven equal<br/>on this evidence"]
  D -->|"no"| FIX["Agent revises the candidate"]
  FIX --> CAND
